 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Fresh fruits and vegetables work well. Avocado, apple slices, cheese slices, sandwich types, crackers, that kind of thing. Then pick things that don't spoil quickly. Avocado is good for a full day. You can also pack a sandwich and some crackers. Pop a bottle of sauce in with it. A small box of chocolates is nice. A tube of toothpaste is useful too. It lasts you the whole hike. If space allows, a plate and some spoons can save you buying fast food at the top.",
